## 🚢 Deployment Script

### For GitHub Pages
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# deploy.sh
git add .
git commit -m "Deploy portfolio"
git push origin main
```

### For Netlify CLI
```bash
npm install -g netlify-cli
netlify deploy --prod --dir=.
```

### For AWS S3
```bash
aws s3 sync . s3://your-bucket-name \
  --delete \
  --exclude ".git/*" \
  --exclude "node_modules/*"
```

